law "archsig.law/2" semantics "archsig/0.6.0";reading Pair{use vocabulary Pair version "1" digest "sha256:37dff1a6692a5762ac29812a6709f41ccfd010f035cfca2ebaa04c0fb78cad12";view all(s:State):Set<State> =set<State>{s};view vacant(s:State):Set<State> =set<State>{};view input(s:State):Z=s.b;view constant(s:State):Z=0;view first(s:State):Z=s.h;change choose(s:State,p:Z,q:Z)=s with{h=p,k=q};law required valid(s:State):s.h=s.b;}